Regenerate the dm-verity hash tree for a partition image rebuilt from a payload

Usage: android-doctor hash-tree [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  The partition image

Options:
      --no-color      Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --output <OUT>  Write the tree here instead of only verifying it
  -h, --help          Print help
